        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6696f616-707e-55c0-bdc4-d87ee05e98a1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Son of the Pink Panther, The Pink Panther, Down by Law, Night on Earth, Coffee and Cigarettes\n- People: Burt Kwouk, Herbert Lom, Graham Stark, Claudia Cardinale, Roberto Benigni, Jim Jarmusch\n- Film Series: The Pink Panther film series\n- Roles: Cato, Inspector Clouseau's son\n\nFacts:\n- Down by Law is a 1986 film directed by Jim Jarmusch, and Roberto Benigni collaborated with Jim Jarmusch in that film.\n- Night on Earth is a 1991 film directed by Jim Jarmusch, and Roberto Benigni collaborated with Jim Jarmusch in that film.\n- Son of the Pink Panther is a 1993 continuation of The Pink Panther film series.\n- In 1993, Roberto Benigni portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in Son of the Pink Panther.\n- Son of the Pink Panther also features Pink Panther regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk, and Graham Stark, along with Claudia Cardinale from the original 1963 The Pink Panther film.\n- Burt Kwouk, born Herbert Tsangtse Kwouk, was a British actor known for playing Cato in the Pink Panther films.\n- Coffee and Cigarettes is a 2003 film directed by Jim Jarmusch, and Roberto Benigni collaborated with Jim Jarmusch in that film.\n- Burt Kwouk was born on 18 July 1930 and died on 24 May 2016.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "b54f3ee9-27c8-5497-9a3c-9d5cc836566b",
        "text": "Page: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Son of the Pink Panther (1993) is a continuation of \"The Pink Panther\" film series.\nPage: Son of the Pink Panther. Sentence: Also in this film are \"Panther\" regulars Herbert Lom, Burt Kwouk and Graham Stark and a star of the original 1963 film, Claudia Cardinale.\nPage: Burt Kwouk. Sentence: Herbert Tsangtse \"Burt\" Kwouk, OBE ( ; ; 18 July 1930 – 24 May 2016) was a British actor, known for his role as Cato in the \"Pink Panther\" films.\nPage: Roberto Benigni. Sentence: He also portrayed Inspector Clouseau's son in \"Son of the Pink Panther\" (1993) and has collaborated with filmmaker Jim Jarmusch in three of his films: \"Down by Law\" (1986), \"Night on Earth\" (1991) and \"Coffee and Cigarettes\" (2003).",
